{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/18/2501130/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/18/2501130/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちらっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋にてセブン-イレブン限定ミニライブイベント！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ来てくださった皆さん\nありがとうございました(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モニターもなくて\n遠くの方は見えにくかったよね。、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その分私はパフォーマンスを\nいつもよりも大きく踊ってみたつもり\nだったのですが、\n少しは伝わりましたか(｡･o･｡)ﾉ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人でも伝わってたらいいな(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/18/2501130/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の髪型は両耳かけの\nストレートでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ったときに髪の毛が\nよく動いて綺麗に見えるのが\nストレートヘア♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜にはご飯を食べる会がありまして\n私も参加しました(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加メンバーは、\nずー、愛未、かりん、琴子と\n人数は少なかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくり全員と話ができて\n普段聞けないような話も聞けて\n凄い楽しかったよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼きを食べました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋なのに！！\n何故！！\nという感じでしたが\nとっても美味しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと写真撮ればよかったな(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして\n明日の全握も楽しみにしてます〜( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんとペアです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅん初！\n長身コンビ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話題よかったら(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・セブンイレブンでよく買うものといえば？\n・オススメの曲は？\n・好きな色は？\n・ぶどう派？マスカット派？\n・ごま油派？オリーブオイル派？\n・黒髪派？茶髪派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん是非教えてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#ChihaOOTD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はファッションというか、\n小物になります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファーストラップ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/18/2501130/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一見普通のストラップに見えますが\n実はこれ、お母さんが作ってくれたんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作ったといっても\nファー等、パーツを買って\nリボンを金具で留めて\nそれを付けた簡単なものですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとってはとても嬉しい\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまとってもファーが流行っていて\nお店でもよく見かけるのですか\n流行りすぎてみんなと被りそう(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思っていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でファーの色を選び\nリボンの色を選び\n自分だけのストラップになったのが\n凄い嬉しいんだ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近お母さんは\nアクセサリー作りにハマっていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イヤリングやピアス、\nブレスレットや指輪まで\n作り始めています。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが中々センスが良い！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんのハンドメイドアクセサリー\nまた紹介します(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「憂、燦々」クリープハイプさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞がとっても可愛い。\nあまのじゃくな感じや\n少し強気な女の子の感じが\n可愛い。\n声にも惹かれる！\n綺麗な高い声が人とは違って\n魅了されます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/18/2501130/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GUAM♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真見てるとやっぱり\n海外行きたいな〜ってなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が行きたいのは\nヨーロッパと\nエジプトと\nモルディブと\nアメリカ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バラバラすぎる！！\nしかもアバウト！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}